# SPEC-012 — Project Workspace
Version: 1.0
Status: Approved
Phase: Sprint 1
Category: Feature Specification

---

# Purpose

The Project Workspace is the heart of Sonic AI V3.

Every creative action happens here.

The workspace is not simply a collection of tools.

It is a living environment that evolves alongside the project.

The longer a project exists, the more intelligently the workspace understands it.

---

# User Promise

"When I enter my project, everything I need is already waiting for me."

---

# Primary Question

"How do I move this project forward?"

---

# Workspace Philosophy

The workspace should never feel static.

It should evolve naturally as the project evolves.

A brand-new demo should feel different than a nearly completed album.

The environment reflects creative progress.

